cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: Behaviour Syllables
abstract: 'Finds unsupervised behavioural syllables in pose kinematics: a sticky autoregressive hidden Markov model (Dynamax)
  on body-aligned posture and movement (default) or keypoint-MoSeq (kpms variant, non-commercial academic licence), fitted
  jointly over sessions; syllable usage, durations, transitions, condition differences and agreement with expert behaviour
  labels. Part of the Pennsieve Markerless Behaviour workflow.'
